@base = http://localhost:8080

### Phase 1
GET {{base}}/hello

### 注册；确认返回 id 与 CURRENT_USER_ID 相同
POST {{base}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"tom","password":"123456"}

### 登录；只验证密码，不创建会话
POST {{base}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"tom","password":"123456"}

### 添加书籍
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Java 入门","author":"示例作者","totalPages":100}

> {% client.global.set("bookId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 阅读中
PUT {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"readPages":25}

### 读完
PUT {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"readPages":100}

### 详情
GET {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}

### 分页
GET {{base}}/books?page=1&size=2

### 删除
DELETE {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}

### 删除后查询应为 404
GET {{base}}/books/{{bookId}}
